<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-month T-bill auction lowest price 99.78.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-month T-bill auction lowest price 99.78.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry said its auction of 1.5 trillion yen worth of six-month Treasury bills on Monday produced the following results:</p>
<p> Lowest price     99.78   Stop rate     0.442 pct</p>
<p> Average price    99.784  Average yield 0.432 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   4.95  trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids	1.50  trillion yen</p>
<p> Bid to cover ratio 3.3  times</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 6.5257 pct</p>
<p> Issue date	 Oct 11, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity    Apr 10, 1997</p>
